text: ['At the beginning of combat this turn, Intervention of Keranos deals 3 damage to each creature.', "At the beginning of the Horde's precombat main phase, reveal an additional card from the top of the Horde's library. The Horde casts that card.\\nHero's Reward — When Altar of Mogis is put into a graveyard from anywhere, the Horde sacrifices two Minotaurs.", "At the beginning of the Horde's precombat main phase, reveal an additional card from the top of the Horde's library. The Horde casts that card.\\nHero's Reward — When Massacre Totem is put into a graveyard from anywhere, put the top seven cards of the Horde's library into its graveyard.", "At the beginning of the Horde's precombat main phase, reveal an additional card from the top of the Horde's library. The Horde casts that card.\\nHero's Reward — When Plundered Statue is put into a graveyard from anywhere, each player draws a card.", "At the beginning of the Horde's precombat main phase, reveal an additional card from the top of the Horde's library. The Horde casts that card.\\nHero's Reward — When Refreshing Elixir is put into a graveyard from anywhere, each player gains 5 life.", "At the beginning of the Horde's precombat main phase, reveal an additional card from the top of the Horde's library. The Horde casts that card.\\nHero's Reward — When Vitality Salve is put into a graveyard from anywhere, each player returns a creature card from their graveyard to the battlefield.", "Each Minotaur can't be blocked this turn except by two or more creatures.", 'Whenever a Minotaur attacks this turn, it gains deathtouch until end of turn.', 'Whenever a Minotaur attacks this turn, it gains first strike until end of turn and must be blocked this turn if able.', 'Whenever a Minotaur attacks this turn, it gets +2/+0 until end of turn. Destroy that creature at end of combat.']
